Sound stage 1 (spescodec=1): codec power, LPASS votes and clocks, macros, SoundWire bring-up.

The RPM link the GPU probe opens is kept and shared (spes_rpm_kvp(); no second GLINK handshake,
which crashed the RPM on topaz) for L14, the WCD937x buck. SpesAudio then asks the AFE for the
LPASS core HW votes (blocks 3 and 4) and clocks 0x30c/0x30d at 19.2 MHz as HackiOS redwood_mic.c
does, and only when all four are given clocks the macros, starts both SoundWire masters with the
WCD937x reset (GPIO92) low, releases it and logs the slaves (Topaz 0145 codec_bringup, same SoC
and codec). Registers are mapped a 16 KB page at a time.

